    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "resilience... i dont know. everyone talks about fighting or holding on, but it just feels so much more undignified to just wait around and get caught in the middle of it all. like, is there any point in fighting an inevitable end, or is there a more dignified way to meet it?",
